Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:04.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（走过的路）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要面对现实 承担起你们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna suck it up, accept your responsibilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,扮演好你们命中注定的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}and play the roles that destiny has chosen for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是那皮囊 米迦勒的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the vessel. Michael's vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的答案是 不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer's no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道我是谁 - 路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know who I am. - Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 就是你 你就是我的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one, Sam. You're my vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 莉莎 情况真的会很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Lisa. Things are about to get really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不管你打算干什么 别去 - 我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whatever you're thinking of doing, don't do it. - I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个关路西法的牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cage you sprung Lucifer from …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.97,0:00:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以再把他扔回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can shove his ass back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要打开牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key to the cage …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.08,0:00:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要天启四骑士手上的四枚戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}four rings from the horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是谁 - 我们的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is it? - That's our brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚当不见了是什么意思 - 天使带走了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean Adam is gone? - The angels took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.51,0:00:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他们放弃你了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're moving on from you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think Adam's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:00:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:00:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.09,0:01:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们引诱路西法到牢笼前 然后我跳进去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you guys lead the devil to the edge and I jump in?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩个傻瓜是不是想气死我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you idjits trying to kill me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.13,0:01:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须让你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to let your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,纵身跳入那个火坑中\N{\fnArial\fs30}jump right into that fiery pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟在害怕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are you afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是怕失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.75,0:01:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是害怕失去你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or losing your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.63,0:01:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,1967年4月21日\N{\fnArial\fs30}On April 21, 1967,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一亿辆通用牌汽车在简斯维尔的工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 100 millionth GM vehicle rolled off the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,生产下线\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the plant in Janesville …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.21,0:01:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一辆蓝色双门的卡普里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A blue two-door Caprice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此举行了一场盛大的典礼 大家纷纷演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a big ceremony, speeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至连副州长都出席了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lieutenant governor even showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.22,0:01:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天之后 另一辆车在同一生产线上下线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days later, another car rolled off that same line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.65,0:01:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她并没有引起外界过多的关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one gave two craps about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.72,0:01:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真是没眼光\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.89,0:01:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这辆1967年款的雪佛兰英帕拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this 1967 Chevrolet Impala.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会成为世上最重要的车…\N{\fnArial\fs30}would turn out to be the most important car …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是最重要的物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the most important object …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为整个宇宙的重中之重\N{\fnArial\fs30}in pretty much the whole universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的第一任车主是赛尔·莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was first owned by Sal Moriarty,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个曾离过两次婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}An alcoholic with two ex-wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,并患有三条动脉阻塞的酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and three blocked arteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,周末时 他会驱车四处 向穷人们分发圣经\N{\fnArial\fs30}On weekends, he'd drive around giving bibles to the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「让世人了解最终末日」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Gettin' folks right for judgment day."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩完全不知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean don't know any of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.62,0:02:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若他们知道 我保证他们会微笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if they did, I bet they'd smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛尔死后 她就被停在一个地处劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Sal died, she ended up at Rainbow Motors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做「彩虹汽车」的二手车店\N{\fnArial\fs30}A used-car lot in Lawrence,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个年轻的陆战队员心血来潮买下了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}where a young marine bought her on impulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他听取了某个朋友的小小建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, after a little advice from a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,故事就是从那里开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's where this story begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.81,0:02:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且将在这里结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here's where it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}In with…?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.03,0:03:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「和路西法对对碰」这事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole "Up with Satan" Thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.77,0:03:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要让我对路西法说同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna let me say yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法命令你去做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not on me to let you do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经长大了 而且长得过大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a grown … well, overgrown … man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想这么做 我会支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is what you want, I'll back your play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全没想到你会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last thing I thought you'd ever say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna lie to you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可完全违背了我的性格\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes against every fiber I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.17,0:03:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, truth is…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾你什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…You know, watching out for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像是我的工作一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kinda been my job, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不只是个工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}But more than that, it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这样的一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kinda who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你不再是个孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a kid anymore, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.65,0:04:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能一直把你当小孩子一样对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't keep treating you like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能我也需要再成熟点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I got to grow up a little, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我们是否有获胜的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if we got a snowball's chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道如果有人能做到的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do know that if anybody can do it…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想这么做…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is what you want…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的想这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this really what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我把他放出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.73,0:04:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须再把他关回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to put him back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第5季第22集]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不习惯你站着跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still can't get used to you at eye level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说对了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, was I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.57,0:05:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如既往的对了 尤达大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}As always, Yoda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所说 里面有两个恶魔小喽啰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two stunt demons inside, just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到血了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.24,0:05:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 全是萨姆的「动力果汁」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all the "Go juice" Sammy can drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.10,0:06:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.81,0:06:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所获不多 你看这些像是预兆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much. These look like omens to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛罗里达的飓风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyclone in Florida,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,底特律的突然降温 洛杉矶的大火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temperature drop in Detroit, Wildfires in l.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 底特律怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What about Detroit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,气温骤降了20度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temp's dropped about 20 degrees,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只发生在市中心半径五个街区的范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only in a five-block radius of downtown motown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.87,0:06:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔在底特律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil's in Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就预兆而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as foreboding goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种程度可太轻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little light in the loafers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡相真可爱 像个小天使对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw. Ain't he a little angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使可不睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels don't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.07,0:07:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我对这事有种不好的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I got a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是有好的预感才怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you'd be nuts to have a good feeling about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,底特律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直说 他会在底特律占有你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always said he'd jump your bones in Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 也许这是他在热烈欢迎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is him rolling out the red carpet, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.05,0:07:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他知道一些我们不知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he knows something that we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.61,0:07:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 他肯定知道一大票我们不知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm sure he knows a buttload we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能希望他不知道戒指的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got to hope he doesn't know about the rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the subject,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.97,0:07:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我得告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I got to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果事情按我们预想的方向发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing goes our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跳进那个笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I…triple lindy into that box…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是有去无回吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Y-you know I'm not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你得答应我一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got to promise me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 尽管说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.85,0:07:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得发誓不会试着救我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to promise not to try to bring me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:07:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.51,0:08:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这我可不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't sign up for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的旅行弄得像绝唱似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hell is gonna make my tour look like graceland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想让我袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you want me just to sit by and do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦牢笼关上 你决不能再去碰它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the cage is shut, you can't go poking at it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太冒险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像我会让你烂在那不管似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if I'm just gonna let you rot in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.50,0:08:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是这样 你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you are. You don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能要求我这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't ask me to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 迪恩 你必须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dean. You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.18,0:08:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不去救你 那我要做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.88,0:08:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go find Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,向上帝祷告让她接纳你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pray to god she's dumb enough to take you in,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们可以吃烤肉 踢球赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you … you have barbecues and go to football games.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要过正常且简单有序的生活 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go live some normal, apple-pie life, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:54.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密歇根州 底特律）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码有两打\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least two dozen of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.83,0:08:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 有事要发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right … something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see ya around, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See ya around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.51,0:09:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他附身之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets in…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拼命与他对抗 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight him tooth and nail, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一直抗争 丝毫不能放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep swingin'. Don't give an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.85,0:09:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:09:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好他们 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of these guys, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不可能「好」的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就假装迁就我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then humor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.11,0:10:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我该说谎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I was supposed to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 他们会没事的 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. They'll be fine. I …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,得得…你还是…别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just … just stop…Talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.97,0:10:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind not watching this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.99,0:10:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了 狗杂种们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here, you sons of bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们老爸在家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your father home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们来看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So nice of you to drop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆英帕拉的零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Impala, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然与其它车并无不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}has all the things other cars have…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有些其它车上没有的装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a few things they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.37,0:11:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But none of that stuff's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是一些小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the stuff that's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.38,0:11:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆塞进烟灰盒里的人偶大兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The army man that Sam crammed in the ashtray…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:11:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今还在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still stuck there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.04,0:12:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩塞进出风口的积木\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legos that Dean shoved into the vents…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.31,0:12:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到今天 暖风一开就能听见它们噼啪作响\N{\fnArial\fs30}To this day, heat comes on and they can hear 'em rattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是这些小东西让这辆车变得完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the things that make the car theirs…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得真正属于他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便是迪恩在车散架之后进行整体大修\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when Dean rebuilt her from the ground up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然没有把这些小东西取出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}he made sure all these little things stayed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这些瑕疵正是她的美丽所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it's the blemishes that make her beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法不知道他们开什么车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil doesn't know or care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}what kind of car the boys drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.57,0:12:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉可能有点儿冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry if it's a bit chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分人都以为我喜欢熊熊烈焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people think I burn hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's actually quite the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我会通知媒体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll alert the media.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 帮我解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me understand something, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 难道你们不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, stomping through my front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯进我家有点儿自取灭亡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is…A tad suicidal, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.09,0:12:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是来和你对抗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not here to fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.55,0:12:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是来做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要同意你附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to say "Yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:12:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了不少阿华田呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chock-full of ovaltine, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.11,0:13:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到我说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.71,0:13:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 审判日的降临无法阻挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Judgment Day's a runaway train.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想通了 我们只求免灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get it now. We just want off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.52,0:13:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,世纪交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal of the century.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意你附身 条件是一切结束之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you a free ride, but when it's all over,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.99,0:13:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩都要活着 我们的父母也要复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live, he lives, you bring our parents back…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.76,0:13:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 咱别演肥皂剧了行么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, can we please drop the telenovela?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道戒指在你们手里 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you have the rings, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.98,0:13:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启四骑士的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Horsemen's rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开我牢笼的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The magic keys to my cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有印象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了萨姆 我从没骗过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam. I've never lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.72,0:13:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你至少也应该给我同样的尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could at least pay me the same respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我不生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'm not mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的意识里较量一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wrestling match inside your noggin…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你我 一局定胜负 不许耍诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you and me, one round, no tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你赢了 就跳回牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win, you jump in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I win…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.37,0:14:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 意下如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把金提琴 赌你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fiddle of gold against your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会比你强\N{\fnArial\fs30}says I'm better than you-ou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经知道了 但是没有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he knows. Doesn't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.84,0:14:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们别无选择 - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't have any other choice. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.32,0:15:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean! - Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.21,0:15:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 - 你得尽快跳进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God! - You got to go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.81,0:15:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.31,0:15:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逗你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just messing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:16:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆早不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy's long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.97,0:16:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有这一天的 在底特律\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would always happen in Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.43,0:17:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel you…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在里面折腾呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scratching away in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你说话 好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the gag off, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.89,0:17:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你误会我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me all wrong, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the bad guy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要从里面把你撕成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna rip you apart from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何如此愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such anger…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}young Skywalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是生谁的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you really angry with?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that face in the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 这对你而言就是个笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure this is all a big joke to you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不尽然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.08,0:18:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等了很久很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a long, long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to admit …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也感觉得到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can feel it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以抑制的兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The exhilaration.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.27,0:18:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know why that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.73,0:18:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们终于合二为一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're two halves made whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天造地设的一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}M.F.E.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.07,0:18:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直没有之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别睁着眼说瞎话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This feels pretty damn far from good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我就在你体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm inside your grapefruit, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.35,0:18:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.67,0:18:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it all …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.81,0:18:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得自己是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}how odd you always felt,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得自己与家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How…out of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是多么格格不入\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that… family of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.11,0:18:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何必要忍受这种家庭呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why shouldn't you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们最多算是抚养你长大而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were foster care … at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.70,0:18:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是你真正的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your real family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:18:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很清楚这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those times you ran away,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是想逃避他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you weren't running from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是想来寻找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were running towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道这并不算坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This doesn't have to be a bad thing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有杀死迪恩对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let Dean live, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.61,0:19:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会带回你的亲朋好友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring your folks back, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我想让你快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to be happy, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的一切我都不稀罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want anything from you…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点回报都不求吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a little payback?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.41,0:19:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些恶魔 看着眼熟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of these little devils look familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是本斯曼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Mr. Bensman…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的小学老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of my grade-school teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叫道格的 是你在东兰辛市的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's your friend Doug from that time in East Lansing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.74,0:19:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有蕾切尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Rachel…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.29,0:19:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的舞伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}your prom date.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特 这就是你的生活历程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester, this is your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.53,0:20:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿撒兹勒那一伙人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Azazel's gang …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.34,0:20:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你还是婴儿的时候就盯上了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching you since you were a rugrat,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.73,0:20:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你像狗一样耍的团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerking you around like a dog on a leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.98,0:20:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你对他们的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how you feel about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.33,0:20:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的感觉和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.51,0:20:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们联手发泄发泄怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say you and I blow off a little steam?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,铺天盖地的灾难报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reports are flooding in …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.07,0:20:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特兰发生了7.6级地震\N{\fnArial\fs30}a 7.6 earthquake in Portland,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,波士顿发生8.1级地震\N{\fnArial\fs30}8.1 in Boston,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,香港 柏林 德黑兰也发生了地震\N{\fnArial\fs30}More in Hong Kong, Berlin, and Tehran.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.99,0:20:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国地质勘探局对此没有任何解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}The U.S.G.S. has no explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只透露死亡人数可能达到六位数\N{\fnArial\fs30}but says to expect a six-figure death toll.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.21,0:20:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you think, genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.37,0:20:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要这么刻薄吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.67,0:20:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议去喝点小酒 寻点小乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest we imbibe copious quantities of alcohol…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.71,0:20:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖等着这一场无法避免的灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait for the inevitable blast wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.71,0:20:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 大诗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well. Thank you, Bukowski.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们怎么阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean, how do we stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.61,0:21:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法会和米迦勒在特定地点会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer will meet Michael on the chosen field,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.69,0:21:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后便是世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the battle of armageddon begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.73,0:21:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那是在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, where's this chosen field?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.32,0:21:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.16,0:21:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总得做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's got to be something that we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.07,0:21:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 迪恩 这一切已成定局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dean. This is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.74,0:21:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我听着 没出息的娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me, you junklessisissy …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.19,0:21:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来就没什么希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was never much hope to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.62,0:21:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道还能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what else to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.98,0:22:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩够没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we having fun yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.70,0:22:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在工作的闲暇\N{\fnArial\fs30}In between jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩有时会抽出一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean would sometimes get a day …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.24,0:22:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时运气够好 就有一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes a week, if they were lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.54,0:22:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会去发点小财 顺利打发时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd pass the time lining their pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆曾坚持用正当手段赚钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam used to insist on honest work,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.18,0:22:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在也赌博骗钱 和哥哥学坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now he hustles pool, like his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.88,0:22:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能随心所欲地去任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could go anywhere and do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.32,0:22:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以开上1千英里去看场黑色安息日的演唱会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They drove 1, 000 miles for an ozzy show,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,开个两天去看场堪萨斯松鹰队的比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days for a jayhawks game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.26,0:22:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当天气晴朗时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when it was clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.89,0:22:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就把车停在路边\N{\fnArial\fs30}They parker in the middle of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.70,0:22:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在车盖上看星星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit on the hood, and watch the stars…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.00,0:22:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一看就是几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}For hours…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此之间相顾无言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without saying a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.31,0:22:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当然不会想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never occurred to them that, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.71,0:23:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能没机会有间真正的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe they never really had a roof and four walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.93,0:23:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实他们从来都不曾无家可归\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they were never, in fact, homeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.88,0:23:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句写得有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good line.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是麦妲小姐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress Magda?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.39,0:23:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是 恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, no, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.66,0:23:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到是你打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, wow. I, uh, I didn't know that you'd call.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.40,0:23:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦妲小姐是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's mistress Magda?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.83,0:23:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 她是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. She's a, uh, a …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.53,0:23:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个亲密的朋友罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a, uh… A close friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.94,0:23:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 肯定不是一点点亲密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll bet … real close.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和贝基怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened to Becky?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.41,0:23:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,处得不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.67,0:23:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太迁就她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had too much respect for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.09,0:23:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你正在召妓是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you really got a whole virgin/hooker thing going on, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.64,0:23:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,得 你不是为这事打电话的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this can't be why you called.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.91,0:23:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆答应了路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.62,0:23:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.35,0:23:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预见到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.25,0:23:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚正写到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just working on the pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.09,0:23:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道最后一战是在哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see where the title fight goes down?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.26,0:23:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们把它作为最高机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels are keeping it top secret …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.63,0:23:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常隐秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very hush-hush.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.69,0:23:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.76,0:23:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我还是看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I saw it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.40,0:23:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是先知的特权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perks of being a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.33,0:24:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天正午\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tomorrow, high noon …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.13,0:24:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫斯塔尔墓地的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place called Stull Cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.57,0:24:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔尔墓…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stull ceme…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.61,0:24:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我知道这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.01,0:24:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在劳伦斯郊外的一个古老墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's … that's an old boneyard outside of Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.74,0:24:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么在劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why Lawrence?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.78,0:24:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.04,0:24:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,万事总得有始有终吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all has to end where it started, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.55,0:24:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 恰克 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Chuck, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.81,0:24:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有其他解决方法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know of any way to short-circuit this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.58,0:24:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了用那些戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides the rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.68,0:24:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道接下来会发生什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do you have any idea what's gonna happen next?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.35,0:24:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.16,0:24:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但目前为止 我真的不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I-I just … I honestly don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.86,0:24:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 谢谢 恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Thanks, chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.90,0:24:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You goin' someplace?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.61,0:24:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是去干蠢事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're goin' to do somethin' stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.21,0:24:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,都写你脸上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.11,0:24:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去和萨姆谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go talk to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.11,0:24:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么就是不放弃呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.95,0:24:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.15,0:24:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在这里都唤不醒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you couldn't reach him here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.58,0:24:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那在战场上就更唤不醒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're certainly not gonna be able to on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.08,0:24:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我们都已经输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we've already lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.52,0:24:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没什么可顾虑了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I got nothing to lose, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.92,0:25:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to understand …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.66,0:25:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你去了也无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that you're gonna see out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.26,0:25:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能眼睁睁看着米迦勒杀死你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is michael killing your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.30,0:25:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也要陪他一起死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I ain't gonna let him die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.34,0:25:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真高兴 米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.96,0:26:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.28,0:26:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等待这一刻已多时\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.88,0:26:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于走到这一步 真是激动人心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe it's finally here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.99,0:26:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.12,0:26:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.26,0:26:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就蓄势待发\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.18,0:26:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心里还有个声音在阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A part of me wishes we didn't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.10,0:26:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.57,0:26:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.74,0:26:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么还要如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.94,0:26:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.01,0:26:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过你的所作所为 我已别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no choice, after what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.65,0:26:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.72,0:26:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那根本不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's not my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.38,0:26:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.55,0:26:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.52,0:26:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲创造了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad made everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.32,0:26:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是他造就了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means he made me who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.76,0:26:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要恶魔存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}God wanted the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.80,0:26:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.13,0:26:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又何必如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.00,0:26:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要让我们自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why make us fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.80,0:27:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't figure out the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.84,0:27:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.37,0:27:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们非要拼个你死我活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.44,0:27:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又是何苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.51,0:27:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为是父亲的考验吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of dad's tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.13,0:27:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们甚至都被蒙在鼓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we don't even know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.82,0:27:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是亲兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.95,0:27:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没必要再受他摆布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just walk off the chessboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.13,0:27:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I-I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.53,0:27:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是忠诚的儿子 必须奉命行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a good son, and I have my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.67,0:27:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必遵守那些命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't have to follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.94,0:27:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是让我堕天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think I'm gonna rebel?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.94,0:27:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.97,0:27:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.67,0:27:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Michael …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.01,0:27:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,弟弟 你真是一点都没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you haven't changed a bit, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.54,0:27:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是埋怨别人 却从不审视自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always blaming everybody but yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.08,0:27:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾在一起的时光是多么快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were together. We were happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.78,0:27:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却背叛了我 我们大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you betrayed me … all of us …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至逼走了我们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you made our father leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人逼迫他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one makes dad do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.54,0:27:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他如此对待我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is doing this to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.14,0:28:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法 你是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a monster, Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.65,0:28:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.98,0:28:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果非要如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's the way it's got to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.22,0:28:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就来试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.74,0:29:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.92,0:29:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 打扰你们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Am I interrupting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.50,0:29:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.67,0:29:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.58,0:29:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管你一直都很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.65,0:29:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但跑来这里 还真是蠢到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is a whole new mountain of stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.51,0:29:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没空理你 我正和萨姆说话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking to you. I'm talking to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.38,0:29:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我已不再需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no longer the vessel, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.92,0:29:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没资格来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no right to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.59,0:29:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当 如果你听得到的话 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam, if you're in there somewhere, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.29,0:29:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚当现在不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adam isn't home right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.09,0:29:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,木鱼脑袋 我回头再来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you're next on my list, buttercup.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.93,0:30:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我得先跟他算账\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now, I need five minutes with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.70,0:30:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这恶心人的蛆虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little maggot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.96,0:30:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没你什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no longer a part of this story!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.23,0:30:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小屁屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ass-butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.51,0:30:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有毛搞错 小屁屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ass-butt"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.85,0:30:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很快就会回来 到时估计气疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be back … and upset …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.19,0:30:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但好歹为你争取了点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got your five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.39,0:30:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.12,0:30:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚是用圣火驱逐了我兄弟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just Molotov my brother with holy fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.50,0:30:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.66,0:30:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我 没人能动米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one dicks with Michael but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.68,0:30:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆 听得见我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.49,0:31:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.25,0:31:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在小萨姆面上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to be nice…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.72,0:31:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你一直很温柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Sammy's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.72,0:31:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.76,0:31:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是我的眼中钉\N{\fnArial\fs30}are such a pain…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.60,0:31:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉中刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.58,0:31:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-o-o-o-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.08,0:31:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.19,0:31:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.86,0:31:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.06,0:31:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是在 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's in here, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.00,0:31:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还要亲自打得你体无完肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's gonna feel the snap of your bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.34,0:31:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不放过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.04,0:32:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna take our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.01,0:32:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.22,0:32:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.02,0:32:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我陪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.19,0:32:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.86,0:32:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都不会离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna ave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.59,0:33:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.43,0:33:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.10,0:33:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制住他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.85,0:33:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.65,0:33:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.59,0:33:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.51,0:34:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.31,0:34:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情不该发展至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna end this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.45,0:34:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.68,0:34:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.35,0:34:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须和我哥哥战斗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to fight my brother, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.62,0:34:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在此时此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.48,0:34:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的宿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.30,0:35:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西 你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.34,0:35:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,比那还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.89,0:36:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西 你是上帝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, are you god?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.75,0:36:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这恭维真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a nice compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.12,0:36:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但答案是不\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.86,0:36:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是相信是他复活了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, I do believe he brought me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.90,0:36:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,使我焕然一新\N{\fnArial\fs30}New and improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.79,0:37:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,结局总是很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Endings are hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.03,0:37:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开头很容易 有个键盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chapped-ass monkey with a keyboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.00,0:37:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,无知脑残也能办到 但结局却非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}can poop out a beginning, but endings are impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.87,0:37:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越想面面俱到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try to tie up every loose end,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.01,0:37:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就越是事与愿违\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you never can.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.21,0:37:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉丝都是群欲求不满的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fans are always gonna bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.14,0:37:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会给你找些碴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always gonna be holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.51,0:37:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然这都是结局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since it's the ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.61,0:37:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也就无所畏惧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all supposed to add up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.28,0:37:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你们 让他们折腾去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, they're a raging pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.65,0:37:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在打算干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.56,0:37:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,回天堂吧 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to heaven, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.91,0:37:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.79,0:37:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于米迦勒也被关进了牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Michael in the cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.20,0:37:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必现在那儿正群龙无首吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it's total anarchy up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.86,0:37:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 那你成了新头目了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you're the new sheriff in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.93,0:37:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿如此 是的 我希望会是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that. Yeah. I suppose I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.87,0:37:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝就赐了你一对全新而又闪亮的翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}God gives you a brand-new, shiny set of wings,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.21,0:37:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是你又立马跪倒在他裤脚下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And suddenly you're his bitch again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.27,0:37:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道上帝有何目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what god wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.35,0:37:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不知道他是否会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if he'll even return.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.74,0:37:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是觉得现在就该这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just…Seems like the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.18,0:37:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 要是你真见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you do see him,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.51,0:37:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他 接下来我跟他没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell him I'm coming for him next.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.08,0:38:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.32,0:38:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还算是温柔的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.52,0:38:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有出手帮过忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.89,0:38:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你没意识到而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even more than we realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.43,0:38:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得倒容易 因为他把你带回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's easy for you to say. He brought you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.09,0:38:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是萨姆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.63,0:38:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.96,0:38:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得到了什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my grand prize?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.70,0:38:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我的弟弟被封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I got is my brother in a hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.57,0:38:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是你想要的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got what you asked for, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.50,0:38:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有天堂 也没有地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No paradise. No hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.62,0:38:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是一切照旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just more of the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.31,0:38:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说真的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.91,0:38:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟想要什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you rather have?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.65,0:38:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,宁静还是自由呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace or freedom?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.46,0:38:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是 说句再见会死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you really suck at goodbyes, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.02,0:38:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之后 迪恩和鲍比将会分别很长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last Dean and Bobby will see of each other for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.51,0:39:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了强调一下 从现在起再过一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, for the record, at this point next week,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.98,0:39:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比将在代顿城外猎杀一个食人怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby will be hunting a rugaru outside of Dayton.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.98,0:39:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但迪恩没有去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.79,0:39:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩并不想卡西救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean didn't want Cass to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.99,0:39:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他浑身上下每寸肌肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every part of him, every fiber he's got,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.22,0:39:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,都无不想要寻死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wants to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.96,0:39:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是想办法找回萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or find a way to bring Sam back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.23,0:39:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不能那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he isn't gonna do either.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.36,0:39:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他对萨姆承诺过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.77,0:39:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.68,0:39:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.98,0:39:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.95,0:39:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.22,0:39:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果还不太晚的话 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, if it's not too late, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.05,0:39:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天你要请我喝的啤酒还作数吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I'd like to take you up on that beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.79,0:39:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都不晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.90,0:40:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.98,0:40:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.29,0:40:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那接下来会怎样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's it all add up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.18,0:40:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.21,0:40:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要我说这只个考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me, I'd say this was a test…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.95,0:40:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对萨姆和迪恩的考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.15,0:40:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他俩干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think they did all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.49,0:40:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,与正邪善恶打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up against good, evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.36,0:40:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭遇天使恶魔 面对宿命 还有上帝本尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels, devils, destiny, and god himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.26,0:40:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们自己做出了选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made their own choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.10,0:40:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们选择了家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}They chose family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.63,0:40:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.03,0:40:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不正是重中之重吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that kinda the whole point?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.84,0:40:43.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（完结）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.11,0:40:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 事到最终总难以放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt … endings are hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.51,0:40:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但话说回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then again…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.98,0:40:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么会真正到头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing ever really ends, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.13,0:41:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.33,0:41:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm good.
